        "jsonHeaders": "={\n  \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n  \"Accept\": \"application/json\"\n}\n",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ \n  JSON.stringify({\n    contents: [\n      {\n        parts: [\n          {\n            text: `You are a search marketing assistant. Follow these steps precisely:\n\nStep 1: Based on the keyword '${$json.keyword}', generate a diverse list of up to 20 highly relevant and commonly searched keywords. Include variations, synonyms, and long-tail terms people may use.\n\nStep 2: Generate a list of up to 35 popular and commonly searched neighborhoods or localities in '${$json.city}', India. Include both well-known and emerging areas if applicable.\n\nStep 3: Combine each keyword from Step 1 with each neighborhood from Step 2 into search-friendly phrases (e.g., 'Hazratganj ${$json.keyword}', 'Gomti Nagar bridal makeup artist').\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Output ONLY the combined search phrases.\n- Output them as a plain comma-separated list, with **no headings, no bullet points, no explanations**.\n- Do NOT summarize or truncate the result.\n- Ensure phrases are clean and readable, in Title Case where appropriate.\n\nReturn only the final list of search phrases, comma-separated.\n`\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }) \n}}\n",
